<SPT><TTL>Hinged Doors</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Frames must be<MET> 32 by 13 by 3 mm</MET><ENG> 1-1/4 by 1/2 by 1/8 inch</ENG> channels with<MET> 32 by 3 mm</MET><ENG> 1-1/4 by 1/8 inch</ENG> flat bar cover on top and bottom rails and 
on hinge stile and a<MET> 35 by 20 by 3 mm</MET><ENG> 1-3/8 by 3/4 by 1/8 inch</ENG> angle riveted to the lock stile.  Provide 1-1/2 pairs of regular weight, wrought 
steel, non-removable pin, butt hinges riveted or welded to the door and the door opening frame for each door.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Sheet Metal Base</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Hot- or cold-rolled sheet steel, not lighter than 16 gage.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
