together with mesh in between.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
<SPT><TTL>Capping Bar</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Structural steel channel,<MET> 75 mm by 1.9 kg</MET><ENG> 3 inch by 4.1 pounds</ENG>.</TXT><BRK/>
